so something was nailed up between those trees a rope let's say but why suppose these poachers

01:06:12.600 --> 01:06:16.040
are like natives in the jungle they always follow the same trail through the woods

01:06:17.210 --> 01:06:24.130
why should anyone it's just another ruddy mystery which will come

