what did that price ridley woman have to say for herself well she says that

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:34.020
colonel is as good as accused whores of petty theft. she reckoned someone like it

01:06:34.020 --> 01:06:38.450
herself. money's missing from the church fund. oh yes and she thinks she heard the

