murderer in the shrubbery. reckoned she heard him sneeze. so all we got to do is

01:06:43.790 --> 01:06:48.630
find someone with a snotty handkerchief. I was out in the garden replenishing my bird

01:06:48.630 --> 01:06:53.030
tree when I heard him. well I thought that's someone who has no business being where they are.

01:06:53.030 --> 01:07:00.000
so I crept indoors and I went upstairs. I can see into the shrubbery when I got there

