01:07:09.250 --> 01:07:14.100
- Miss Marple.

01:07:14.100 --> 01:07:16.000
- I brought it down here because,

01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:16.840
well, I don't know why.

01:07:16.840 --> 01:07:18.600
I wonder if you'd mind taking it away for me.

01:07:18.600 --> 01:07:19.520
- Of course not.

01:07:19.520 --> 01:07:20.720
- It's horrible.

01:07:20.720 --> 01:07:22.880
