01:07:28.370 --> 01:07:30.000
It's such an unpleasant incident.

01:07:30.250 --> 01:07:34.210
sure it isn't a portrait of anyone I know. why should it affect me? on top of

01:07:34.210 --> 01:07:42.250
everything else. I know. I know. it's like an attack on someone. a desecration. makes the

01:07:42.250 --> 01:07:46.830
place even more difficult. oh Juan and his wife are very sweet but... why don't you come and stay with us?

01:07:46.830 --> 01:07:55.080
may I? perhaps. after Lawrence has gone. I've sent him away you know. he'll be gone as soon as he

