I've got to go it wouldn't be fair to Ann she's going to hang on just to sign us a

01:08:16.990 --> 01:08:23.490
few times on this wretched place to show she's not ashamed then we'll get married

01:08:23.490 --> 01:08:28.740
I wish to God it hadn't had to be like this

01:08:30.160 --> 01:08:34.560
but Anne's independent now and she can spit on this village and all its works.

01:08:34.560 --> 01:08:38.240
you know i can sympathize with that attitude.

01:08:38.240 --> 01:08:41.560
i sometimes feel very drawn to a jealous god.

01:08:41.560 --> 01:08:44.920
who the hell could have done it vicar?

01:08:44.920 --> 01:08:49.140
i don't know. sometimes i feel it was someone who...

01:08:49.140 --> 01:08:58.480
i'll tell you what i think. i think it was someone who was crazy.

01:09:00.220 --> 01:09:03.050
Probably not had enemies, sure, but to kill him?

01:09:03.050 --> 01:09:07.750
