01:09:57.590 --> 01:09:59.730
Goodness knows it's affected the whole place.

01:10:01.210 --> 01:10:04.320
- I'll get Griselda to have a word with him tomorrow.

01:10:04.320 --> 01:10:13.130
I intimidate him, according to her.

01:10:13.130 --> 01:10:18.910
- Now, the day before the murder,

01:10:18.910 --> 01:10:21.870
you got Dr. Haydock to drive you to the old hall?

01:10:21.870 --> 01:10:25.090
- Yes, I did, to speak to Colonel Protherham.

01:10:25.090 --> 01:10:28.630
- Can you indicate to me the nature of that interview?

01:10:28.630 --> 01:10:29.220
- No.

01:10:31.240 --> 01:10:35.320
I'm afraid I must insist, Mrs. Lestrange.

01:10:35.320 --> 01:10:37.680
No, Inspector.

01:10:37.680 --> 01:10:42.400
I will assure you that nothing which was said at the interview could possibly have any bearing-

01:10:42.400 --> 01:10:46.760
We have statements to the effect that this interview got very acrimonious.

01:10:46.760 --> 01:10:50.530
Colonel Prothero lost his temper, certainly.

01:10:50.530 --> 01:10:54.070
But then he was prone to that.

01:10:54.070 --> 01:10:55.620
I am not.

01:10:55.620 --> 01:10:57.170
And I didn't.

01:10:57.170 --> 01:10:58.960
And you won't tell me what was discussed?

01:11:01.120 --> 01:11:03.260
No.

01:11:03.260 --> 01:11:05.840
Mrs. LaBloody Strange.

01:11:05.840 --> 01:11:13.170
I know her game of blackmail.

01:11:13.170 --> 01:11:17.180
She was blackmailing Prothero.

01:11:17.180 --> 01:11:20.120
He refused to pay, threatened to expose her.

01:11:20.120 --> 01:11:26.500
Inspector, have you been questioning Mrs. LaStrange?

01:11:26.500 --> 01:11:29.070
Trying to.

01:11:29.070 --> 01:11:30.000
Could I have a word incompetent?

01:11:36.040 --> 01:11:39.150
I had hoped to catch her before you went in to see her.

01:11:39.150 --> 01:11:48.650
This is in the script that's coming to you out.

01:11:48.650 --> 01:11:53.190
Ask ourselves the question, did Pugin and Morris work and die in vain?

01:11:53.190 --> 01:11:56.340
