her to keep her bloody stupid ideas to herself. there's a law called criminal

01:15:12.450 --> 01:15:15.810
libel in this country you know and I'm damned if I'm gonna have my name smeared

01:15:15.810 --> 01:15:26.490
by a half-witted little tart like her. you poor thing. don't worry. lettuce is coming to stay with me. oh come in.

01:15:40.110 --> 01:15:43.860
We both suffered too much at the hands of that man not to be friends.

01:15:43.860 --> 01:15:51.920
